<description>WE-DD SMT Shielded Coupled Inductor

Characteristics
1:1 transformer
Double inductor with two identical windings
5 different sizes available
Operating temperature: –40 ºC to +125 ºC
Recommended solder profile: Reflow
Custom designs on request

Applications
For SEPIC and CUK topologies
Flyback applications
Switching regulators with second, unregulated output voltage

